(1934, 13, 100, 'Dalam beberapa tahun terakhir, universitas internasional memperkenalkan kurikulum baru, yang banyak mahasiswa butuhkan untuk menghadapi pasar kerja global. Pemerintah di berbagai negara merancang kebijakan pendidikan, yang masyarakat tuntut demi meningkatkan akses kesetaraan. Perusahaan teknologi mendanai riset ilmiah, yang para peneliti harapkan dapat menghasilkan solusi ramah lingkungan. Lembaga swadaya masyarakat meluncurkan program pelatihan, yang banyak komunitas lokal ikuti untuk memperbaiki keterampilan kerja. Sementara itu, para pendidik mengembangkan metode pembelajaran daring, yang siswa dari daerah terpencil gunakan untuk memperoleh akses pendidikan berkualitas.', 'In recent years, international universities have introduced new curricula, which many students need to face the global job market. Governments in various countries design education policies, which society demands to improve equal access. Technology companies fund scientific research, which researchers hope can produce environmentally friendly solutions. Non-governmental organizations launch training programs, which many local communities follow to improve work skills. Meanwhile, educators develop online learning methods, which students from remote areas use to obtain access to quality education.', NULL, NULL, '{"Curriculum":"Kurikulum","Job market":"Pasar kerja","Policy":"Kebijakan","Demand":"Menuntut","Equal access":"Akses kesetaraan","Fund":"Mendanai","Scientific research":"Riset ilmiah","Environmentally friendly":"Ramah lingkungan","Non-governmental organization":"Lembaga swadaya masyarakat","Training program":"Program pelatihan","Work skills":"Keterampilan kerja","Educator":"Pendidik","Online learning":"Pembelajaran daring","Remote area":"Daerah terpencil","Quality education":"Pendidikan berkualitas"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:49', '2026-03-16 03:04:49', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'paragraph'),
