(1999, 17, 16, 'Apa yang terjadi di pada suku Anasazi sebelum abad 12 menjadi bahan perdebatan banyak ahli.', 'What happened to the Anasazi tribe before the 12th century is a matter of debate among many experts', 'Apa yang terjadi pada suku Inca sebelum abad 16 menjadi bahan perdebatan banyak sejarawan.', 'What happened to the Inca tribe before the 16th century is a matter of debate among many historians.', '{"Happen":{"id":"Terjadi","pos":"(v)"},"Tribe":{"id":"Suku","pos":"(n)"},"Century":{"id":"Abad","pos":"(n)"},"Matter of debate":{"id":"Bahan perdebatan","pos":"(n)"},"Expert":{"id":"Ahli","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2000, 17, 17, 'Apa yang ahli ekonomi acu sebagai sebuah pilihan marginal adalah pilihan untuk memproduksi atau mengkonsumsi jasa atau barang selanjutnya.', 'What economists refer to as a marginal choice is the choice to produce or consume the next service or good', 'Apa yang ahli biologi acu sebagai sebuah mutasi genetik adalah perubahan untuk menghasilkan atau mengadaptasi sifat atau karakteristik selanjutnya.', 'What biologists refer to as a genetic mutation is the change to produce or adapt the next trait or characteristic.', '{"Economist":{"id":"Ahli ekonomi","pos":"(n)"},"Refer to":{"id":"Acu sebagai","pos":"(v)"},"Marginal choice":{"id":"Pilihan marginal","pos":"(n)"},"Produce":{"id":"Memproduksi","pos":"(v)"},"Consume":{"id":"Mengkonsumsi","pos":"(v)"},"Service":{"id":"Jasa","pos":"(n)"},"Good":{"id":"Barang","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2001, 17, 18, 'Apa yang ratu lebah konsumsi berbeda dengan apa yang lebah pekerja konsumsi.', 'What the queen bee consumes differs from what worker bees consume', 'Apa yang burung hantu konsumsi berbeda dengan apa yang burung elang konsumsi.', 'What owls consume differs from what eagles consume.', '{"Queen bee":{"id":"Ratu lebah","pos":"(n)"},"Consume":{"id":"Konsumsi","pos":"(v)"},"Differ":{"id":"Berbeda","pos":"(v)"},"Worker bee":{"id":"Lebah pekerja","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2002, 17, 100, 'Banyak orang masih memperdebatkan apakah teknologi nuklir lebih membawa manfaat atau bahaya bagi umat manusia. Beberapa ilmuwan percaya bahwa energi nuklir adalah solusi terbaik untuk krisis energi global, karena efisiensinya yang tinggi dan emisi karbon yang rendah. Namun, masyarakat umum sering kali mengkhawatirkan apa yang bisa terjadi jika terjadi kebocoran reaktor atau penyalahgunaan bahan radioaktif. Fakta bahwa beberapa negara menggunakan teknologi ini untuk membuat senjata pemusnah massal semakin memperkuat rasa takut itu. Oleh karena itu, penting untuk mempertimbangkan bagaimana teknologi ini digunakan dan siapa yang mengendalikannya sebelum memutuskan arah pengembangannya di masa depan.', 'Many people still debate whether nuclear technology brings more benefits or harm to humanity. Some scientists believe that nuclear energy is the best solution to the global energy crisis, because of its high efficiency and low carbon emissions. However, the general public often worries about what could happen if a reactor leak or misuse of radioactive materials occurs. The fact that some countries use this technology to make weapons of mass destruction further reinforces that fear. Therefore, it is important to consider how this technology is used and who controls it before deciding its development direction in the future.', NULL, NULL, '{"Debate":{"id":"Memperdebatkan","pos":"(v)"},"Nuclear technology":{"id":"Teknologi nuklir","pos":"(n)"},"Benefit":{"id":"Manfaat","pos":"(n)"},"Harm":{"id":"Bahaya","pos":"(n)"},"Humanity":{"id":"Umat manusia","pos":"(n)"},"Energy crisis":{"id":"Krisis energi","pos":"(n)"},"Efficiency":{"id":"Efisiensi","pos":"(n)"},"Carbon emission":{"id":"Emisi karbon","pos":"(n)"},"Worry":{"id":"Mengkhawatirkan","pos":"(v)"},"Reactor leak":{"id":"Kebocoran reaktor","pos":"(n)"},"Radioactive material":{"id":"Bahan radioaktif","pos":"(n)"},"Weapon of mass destruction":{"id":"Senjata pemusnah massal","pos":"(n)"},"Reinforce":{"id":"Memperkuat","pos":"(v)"},"Consider":{"id":"Mempertimbangkan","pos":"(v)"},"Control":{"id":"Mengendalikan","pos":"(v)"},"Future":{"id":"Masa depan","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'paragraph'),
(2003, 18, 1, 'Archaebacteria adalah kelompok bakteri yang termasuk prokariot yang tinggal di lingkungan ekstrim seperti gunung berapi atau danau asin.', 'Archaebacteria is a bacteria group including prokaryotic bacteria living in extreme environments such as volcanoes or salt water lakes', 'Plankton adalah kelompok organisme yang termasuk autotrof yang melayang di perairan dangkal seperti muara sungai atau teluk terlindung.', 'Plankton is an organism group including autotrophs floating in shallow waters such as river estuaries or sheltered bays.', '{"Bacteria group":{"id":"Kelompok bakteri","pos":"(n)"},"Include":{"id":"Termasuk","pos":"(v)"},"Extreme environment":{"id":"Lingkungan ekstrim","pos":"(n)"},"Volcano":{"id":"Gunung berapi","pos":"(n)"},"Salt water lake":{"id":"Danau asin","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2004, 18, 2, 'Selain memiliki kombinasi yang unik dari gen, spesies mungkin juga memiliki variasi dalam bentuk dan komposisi dari kromosom yang membawa gen.', 'Besides having a unique combination of genes, species may also have variations in the form and composition of chromosomes carrying genes', 'Selain memiliki desain yang inovatif dari arsitektur, gedung mungkin juga memiliki keunikan dalam gaya dan material dari fondasi yang menopang struktur.', 'Besides having an innovative design of architecture, buildings may also have uniqueness in the style and material of foundations supporting structures.', '{"Unique combination":{"id":"Kombinasi unik","pos":"(n)"},"Gene":{"id":"Gen","pos":"(n)"},"Variation":{"id":"Variasi","pos":"(n)"},"Composition":{"id":"Komposisi","pos":"(n)"},"Chromosome":{"id":"Kromosom","pos":"(n)"},"Carry":{"id":"Membawa","pos":"(v)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2005, 18, 3, 'Dam-dam yang dibangun untuk pengendali banjir bisa memberikan orang-orang yang tinggal di hilir dari dam sebuah rasa keamanan palsu.', 'Dams built for flood control can give people living downstream from the dam a false sense of security', 'Jalan-jalan yang dibangun untuk transportasi umum bisa memberikan pengendara-pengendara yang berkendara di jalur dari jalan sebuah akses mobilitas lancar.', 'Roads built for public transportation can give drivers driving in the lanes from the road an access to smooth mobility.', '{"Flood control":{"id":"Pengendali banjir","pos":"(n)"},"Downstream":{"id":"Hilir","pos":"(n)"},"False sense":{"id":"Rasa palsu","pos":"(n)"},"Security":{"id":"Keamanan","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2006, 18, 4, 'Charles Darwin adalah ilmuwan yang mengembangkan teori evolusi melalui seleksi alam.', 'Charles Darwin is a scientist developing the theory of evolution through natural selection', 'Marie Curie adalah peneliti yang menemukan unsur radium melalui eksperimen kimia.', 'Marie Curie is a researcher discovering the element radium through chemical experiments.', '{"Scientist":{"id":"Ilmuwan","pos":"(n)"},"Develop":{"id":"Mengembangkan","pos":"(v)"},"Theory of evolution":{"id":"Teori evolusi","pos":"(n)"},"Natural selection":{"id":"Seleksi alam","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2007, 18, 5, 'Pemanasan global yang disebabkan oleh meningkatnya jumlah karbon di atmosfer merupakan akibat langsung dari revolusi industri.', 'Global warming caused by increasing amounts of carbon in the atmosphere is a direct result of the industrial revolution', 'Urbanisasi yang disebabkan oleh meningkatnya migrasi penduduk di kota merupakan tantangan langsung terhadap infrastruktur publik.', 'Urbanization caused by increasing population migration in cities is a direct challenge to public infrastructure.', '{"Global warming":{"id":"Pemanasan global","pos":"(n)"},"Cause":{"id":"Menyebabkan","pos":"(v)"},"Increase":{"id":"Meningkat","pos":"(v)"},"Amount":{"id":"Jumlah","pos":"(n)"},"Atmosphere":{"id":"Atmosfer","pos":"(n)"},"Direct result":{"id":"Akibat langsung","pos":"(n)"},"Industrial revolution":{"id":"Revolusi industri","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2008, 18, 6, 'Revolusi Industri adalah periode sejarah yang mengubah struktur ekonomi dan sosial di Eropa.', 'The Industrial Revolution is a historical period changing economic and social structures in Europe', 'Pencerahan adalah zaman intelektual yang mengubah pemikiran politik dan ilmiah di Prancis.', 'The Enlightenment is an intellectual age changing political and scientific thinking in France.', '{"Historical period":{"id":"Periode sejarah","pos":"(n)"},"Change":{"id":"Mengubah","pos":"(v)"},"Economic structure":{"id":"Struktur ekonomi","pos":"(n)"},"Social structure":{"id":"Struktur sosial","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2009, 18, 7, 'Pertumbuhan per capita Cina yang berata-rata 8.7 percent pada tahun 1990-2005 adalah salah satu pertumbuhan ekonomi tercepat di Dunia.', 'China\'s per capita growth averaging 8.7 percent in 1990-2005 is one of the fastest economic growths in the World', 'Investasi per kapita Singapura yang berata-rata 7.5 persen pada tahun 2015-2025 adalah salah satu pertumbuhan modal terkuat di dunia.', 'Singapore\'s per capita investment averaging 7.5 percent in 2015-2025 is one of the strongest capital growths in the world.', '{"Per capita growth":{"id":"Pertumbuhan per kapita","pos":"(n)"},"Average":{"id":"Berata-rata","pos":"(v)"},"Fastest":{"id":"Tercepat","pos":"(adj)"},"Economic growth":{"id":"Pertumbuhan ekonomi","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2010, 18, 8, 'Ekosistem hutan hujan yang telah menjadi sumber oxygen dunia sedang terancam oleh penebangan pohon liar.', 'Rainforest ecosystems having become the world\'s oxygen source are being threatened by illegal logging', 'Ekosistem padang rumput yang telah menjadi tempat hidup mamalia besar sedang terancam oleh perubahan iklim ekstrem.', 'Grassland ecosystems having become large mammal habitats are being threatened by extreme climate change.', '{"Rainforest ecosystem":{"id":"Ekosistem hutan hujan","pos":"(n)"},"Oxygen source":{"id":"Sumber oksigen","pos":"(n)"},"Threaten":{"id":"Mengancam","pos":"(v)"},"Illegal logging":{"id":"Penebangan liar","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2011, 18, 9, 'Banyak sumber air di dataran tinggi berasal dari glasier yang mencair di musim semi.', 'Many water sources in the highlands come from glaciers melting in spring', 'Banyak cadangan minyak di laut dalam berasal dari endapan organik yang mengeras di era purba.', 'Many oil reserves in the deep sea come from organic sediments hardening in ancient eras.', '{"Water source":{"id":"Sumber air","pos":"(n)"},"Highlands":{"id":"Dataran tinggi","pos":"(n)"},"Glacier":{"id":"Glasier","pos":"(n)"},"Melt":{"id":"Mencair","pos":"(v)"},"Spring":{"id":"Musim semi","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2012, 18, 10, 'Berbeda dengan glasiasi Phanerozoic, glasisasi Hirnantian bertahan kurang dari 1 juta tahun dengan kondisi glasiasi penuh yang bertahan 200.000 tahun.', 'Unlike Phanerozoic glaciation, Hirnantian glaciation lasted less than 1 million years with full glaciation conditions lasting 200,000 years', 'Berbeda dengan dinasti Ming, dinasti Qing berkuasa lebih dari 250 tahun dengan sistem pemerintahan monarki yang berlangsung 200 tahun.', 'Unlike the Ming dynasty, the Qing dynasty ruled more than 250 years with a monarchy government system lasting 200 years.', '{"Unlike":{"id":"Berbeda dengan","pos":"(prep)"},"Glaciation":{"id":"Glasiasi","pos":"(n)"},"Last":{"id":"Bertahan","pos":"(v)"},"Condition":{"id":"Kondisi","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2013, 18, 11, 'Penggunaan pestisida sintetis meningkatkan ketergantungan kita pada pestisida dalam proses yang disebut "pesticide treadmill".', 'The use of synthetic pesticide improves our dependency on pesticide in a process called "pesticide treadmill"', 'Penggunaan energi terbarukan meningkatkan keberlanjutan kita pada lingkungan dalam pendekatan yang disebut "green economy".', 'The use of renewable energy improves our sustainability on the environment in an approach called "green economy".', '{"Synthetic pesticide":{"id":"Pestisida sintetis","pos":"(n)"},"Improve":{"id":"Meningkatkan","pos":"(v)"},"Dependency":{"id":"Ketergantungan","pos":"(n)"},"Process":{"id":"Proses","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `grammar_questions` (`id`, `meeting_number`, `question_number`, `question_text`, `correct_answer`, `example_id`, `example_en`, `vocab`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `tense`, `structure`, `formula`, `example`, `vocabulary`, `section`) VALUES
(2014, 18, 12, 'Iklim juga mempengaruhi aktivitas manusia, seperti pertanian yang dipengaruhi oleh lama dari musim tanam, jumlah, dan distribusi dari hutan hujan dan temperatur.', 'Climate also affects human activities, such as agriculture affected by the length of the growing season, amount, and distribution of rainfall and temperature', 'Teknologi juga mempengaruhi gaya hidup modern, seperti komunikasi yang dipengaruhi oleh kecepatan dari jaringan internet, bandwidth, dan distribusi dari sinyal dan konektivitas.', 'Technology also affects modern lifestyles, such as communication affected by the speed of internet networks, bandwidth, and distribution of signals and connectivity.', '{"Climate":{"id":"Iklim","pos":"(n)"},"Affect":{"id":"Mempengaruhi","pos":"(v)"},"Agriculture":{"id":"Pertanian","pos":"(n)"},"Growing season":{"id":"Musim tanam","pos":"(n)"},"Rainfall":{"id":"Curah hujan","pos":"(n)"},"Temperature":{"id":"Temperatur","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2015, 18, 13, 'Ekonomi dari Gulf Cooperation Council (GCC) bergantung sepenuhnya pada produksi dari minyak dan semua sektor ekonomi yang berkutat pada keuntungan yang dihasilkan oleh ekspor minyak.', 'The economy of the Gulf Cooperation Council (GCC) depends entirely on oil production and all economic sectors revolving around profits generated by oil exports', 'Pendidikan dari negara-negara Skandinavia bergantung sebagian pada investasi dari pemerintah dan semua program sosial yang berfokus pada kesejahteraan yang dihasilkan oleh kebijakan publik.', 'Education of Scandinavian countries depends partially on government investment and all social programs focusing on welfare generated by public policies.', '{"Economy":{"id":"Ekonomi","pos":"(n)"},"Depend entirely":{"id":"Bergantung sepenuhnya","pos":"(v)"},"Oil production":{"id":"Produksi minyak","pos":"(n)"},"Revolve around":{"id":"Berkutat pada","pos":"(v)"},"Profit":{"id":"Keuntungan","pos":"(n)"},"Generate":{"id":"Dihasilkan","pos":"(v)"},"Oil export":{"id":"Ekspor minyak","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2016, 18, 14, 'Dengan menghancurkan bebatuan, lichen melepaskan ke kolam, danau, dan sungai komponen fosfat dan nitrat yang diperlukan oleh organisme, oleh karena itu menghasilkan nutrisi untuk mikroba tanah dan akar-akar tanaman.', 'By destroying rocks, lichen releases into pools, lakes, and rivers phosphate and nitrate components required by organisms, therefore producing nutrients for soil microbes and plant roots', 'Dengan memproses limbah organik, tanaman melepaskan ke udara, tanah, dan air komponen metana dan amonia yang dibutuhkan oleh mikroba, oleh karena itu menghasilkan kompos untuk kebun dan ladang.', 'By processing organic waste, plants release into the air, soil, and water methane and ammonia components needed by microbes, therefore producing compost for gardens and fields.', '{"Destroy":{"id":"Menghancurkan","pos":"(v)"},"Rock":{"id":"Bebatuan","pos":"(n)"},"Release":{"id":"Melepaskan","pos":"(v)"},"Component":{"id":"Komponen","pos":"(n)"},"Require":{"id":"Diperlukan","pos":"(v)"},"Produce":{"id":"Menghasilkan","pos":"(v)"},"Nutrient":{"id":"Nutrisi","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2017, 18, 15, 'Fosil-fosil yang ditemukan dari ikan paus purba menunjukkan bahwa mereka masih memiliki kaki belakang 40.000 juta tahun yang lalu.', 'Fossils found from ancient whales show that they still had hind legs 40,000 million years ago', 'Manuskrip-manuskrip yang ditemukan dari perpustakaan Alexandria menunjukkan bahwa mereka sudah memiliki pengetahuan matematika 2.000 tahun yang lalu.', 'Manuscripts found from the Alexandria library show that they already had mathematical knowledge 2,000 years ago.', '{"Fossil":{"id":"Fosil","pos":"(n)"},"Ancient whale":{"id":"Ikan paus purba","pos":"(n)"},"Show":{"id":"Menunjukkan","pos":"(v)"},"Hind leg":{"id":"Kaki belakang","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2018, 18, 16, 'Penelitian yang dilakukan di dalam laboratorium biologi molekuler telah menunjukkan bahwa sejumlah besar spesies memiliki variasi genetik yang rendah yang disebabkan oleh pengurangan ukuran populasi.', 'Research conducted in molecular biology laboratories has shown that a large number of species have low genetic variation caused by population size reduction', 'Studi yang dilakukan di dalam pusat penelitian antariksa telah menunjukkan bahwa sejumlah besar planet memiliki atmosfer tipis yang disebabkan oleh radiasi matahari.', 'Studies conducted in space research centers have shown that a large number of planets have thin atmospheres caused by solar radiation.', '{"Research":{"id":"Penelitian","pos":"(n)"},"Conduct":{"id":"Dilakukan","pos":"(v)"},"Molecular biology":{"id":"Biologi molekuler","pos":"(n)"},"Genetic variation":{"id":"Variasi genetik","pos":"(n)"},"Reduction":{"id":"Pengurangan","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2019, 18, 17, 'Hypsodont terdiri dari serangkaian laminae tipis yang terbentuk dari enamel yang dikelilingi oleh dentine dengan cementun diantara tiap lamina.', 'Hypsodont consists of a series of thin laminae formed from enamel surrounded by dentine with cementum between each lamina', 'Mesin terdiri dari serangkaian komponen mekanis yang terbuat dari logam yang dihubungkan oleh baut dengan pelumas diantara tiap bagian.', 'Machines consist of a series of mechanical components made from metal connected by bolts with lubricant between each part.', '{"Consist of":{"id":"Terdiri dari","pos":"(v)"},"Series":{"id":"Serangkaian","pos":"(n)"},"Form":{"id":"Terbentuk","pos":"(v)"},"Surround":{"id":"Dikelilingi","pos":"(v)"},"Between":{"id":"Diantara","pos":"(prep)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2020, 18, 18, 'Karena properti intelektual adalah dalam jangkauan nasional, level dari perlindungan yang disediakan oleh instrumen semacam ini bisa bervariasi di seluruh negara.', 'Because intellectual property is within national reach, the level of protection provided by such instruments can vary across countries', 'Karena paten adalah dalam jangkauan global, standar dari lisensi yang disediakan oleh organisasi semacam ini bisa berbeda di seluruh wilayah.', 'Because patents are within global reach, the standard of licensing provided by such organizations can differ across regions.', '{"Intellectual property":{"id":"Properti intelektual","pos":"(n)"},"National scope":{"id":"Jangkauan nasional","pos":"(n)"},"Protection":{"id":"Perlindungan","pos":"(n)"},"Provide":{"id":"Disediakan","pos":"(v)"},"Vary":{"id":"Bervariasi","pos":"(v)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2021, 18, 19, 'Sebuah joint venture adalah sebuah mekanisme bisnis untuk menggabungkan aset komplementer yang dimiliki oleh perusahaan yang berbeda.', 'A joint venture is a business mechanism for combining complementary assets owned by different companies', 'Sebuah kemitraan strategis adalah sebuah pendekatan kolaboratif untuk mengintegrasikan sumber daya spesifik yang dimiliki oleh organisasi yang berbeda.', 'A strategic partnership is a collaborative approach for integrating specific resources owned by different organizations.', '{"Joint venture":{"id":"Usaha patungan","pos":"(n)"},"Mechanism":{"id":"Mekanisme","pos":"(n)"},"Combine":{"id":"Menggabungkan","pos":"(v)"},"Complementary asset":{"id":"Aset komplementer","pos":"(n)"},"Own":{"id":"Dimiliki","pos":"(v)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2022, 18, 20, 'Akhir dari periode Permian yang ditandai dengan kepunahan dari banyak kelompok organisme yang telah mendominasi lingkungan laut dan darat selama ratusan juta tahun membukakan jalan bagi ekspansi dari fauna modern saat ini.', 'The end of the Permian period marked by the extinction of many groups of organisms having dominated marine and terrestrial environments for hundreds of millions of years paved the way for the expansion of modern fauna today', 'Awal dari era digital yang ditandai dengan kemunculan dari banyak platform teknologi yang telah mengubah cara komunikasi dan bisnis selama puluhan tahun membuka peluang bagi pertumbuhan dari ekonomi digital saat ini.', 'The beginning of the digital era marked by the emergence of many technology platforms having changed communication and business methods for decades opened opportunities for the growth of the digital economy today.', '{"Mark":{"id":"Ditandai","pos":"(v)"},"Extinction":{"id":"Kepunahan","pos":"(n)"},"Dominate":{"id":"Mendominasi","pos":"(v)"},"Marine":{"id":"Laut","pos":"(adj)"},"Terrestrial":{"id":"Darat","pos":"(adj)"},"Pave the way":{"id":"Membukakan jalan","pos":"(v)"},"Expansion":{"id":"Ekspansi","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2023, 18, 21, 'Para ilmuwan menemukan spesies living di hutan tropis terpencil.', 'Scientists discover species living in remote tropical forests', 'Para peneliti mengamati mikroba thriving di mata air panas yang terisolasi.', 'Researchers observe microbes thriving in isolated hot springs.', '{"Discover":{"id":"Menemukan","pos":"(v)"},"Species":{"id":"Spesies","pos":"(n)"},"Remote":{"id":"Terpencil","pos":"(adj)"},"Tropical forest":{"id":"Hutan tropis","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2024, 18, 22, 'Kota besar memiliki sistem transportasi connecting berbagai wilayah secara efisien.', 'Big cities have transportation systems connecting various regions efficiently', 'Negara maju membangun jaringan komunikasi linking berbagai pulau secara cepat.', 'Developed countries build communication networks linking various islands quickly.', '{"Transportation system":{"id":"Sistem transportasi","pos":"(n)"},"Connect":{"id":"Menghubungkan","pos":"(v)"},"Various":{"id":"Berbagai","pos":"(adj)"},"Region":{"id":"Wilayah","pos":"(n)"},"Efficiently":{"id":"Secara efisien","pos":"(adv)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2025, 18, 23, 'Peneliti menerbitkan artikel tentang teknologi improving kualitas energi terbarukan.', 'Researchers publish articles about technology improving renewable energy quality', 'Insinyur mengembangkan inovasi tentang perangkat enhancing efisiensi panel surya.', 'Engineers develop innovations about devices enhancing solar panel efficiency.', '{"Researcher":{"id":"Peneliti","pos":"(n)"},"Publish":{"id":"Menerbitkan","pos":"(v)"},"Article":{"id":"Artikel","pos":"(n)"},"Improve":{"id":"Meningkatkan","pos":"(v)"},"Renewable energy":{"id":"Energi terbarukan","pos":"(n)"},"Quality":{"id":"Kualitas","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2026, 18, 24, 'Perusahaan meluncurkan perangkat containing fitur keamanan digital terbaru.', 'Companies launch devices containing the latest digital security features', 'Produsen merilis aplikasi offering sistem navigasi pintar terkini.', 'Producers release applications offering the latest smart navigation systems.', '{"Launch":{"id":"Meluncurkan","pos":"(v)"},"Device":{"id":"Perangkat","pos":"(n)"},"Contain":{"id":"Berisi","pos":"(v)"},"Feature":{"id":"Fitur","pos":"(n)"},"Security":{"id":"Keamanan","pos":"(n)"},"Latest":{"id":"Terbaru","pos":"(adj)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2027, 18, 25, 'Sungai panjang itu mendukung masyarakat depending pada air untuk pertanian.', 'The long river supports communities depending on water for agriculture', 'Danau besar itu menciptakan ekosistem relying pada oksigen untuk kehidupan akuatik.', 'The large lake creates ecosystems relying on oxygen for aquatic life.', '{"Support":{"id":"Mendukung","pos":"(v)"},"Community":{"id":"Masyarakat","pos":"(n)"},"Depend on":{"id":"Bergantung pada","pos":"(v)"},"Agriculture":{"id":"Pertanian","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2028, 18, 26, 'Kota kuno itu ditemukan dengan sisa bangunan built pada abad ke-5 sebelum masehi.', 'The ancient city was found with building remains built in the 5th century BC', 'Benteng bersejarah itu ditemukan dengan struktur pertahanan constructed pada abad ke-12 masehi.', 'The historical fortress was found with defense structures constructed in the 12th century AD.', '{"Ancient city":{"id":"Kota kuno","pos":"(n)"},"Found":{"id":"Ditemukan","pos":"(v)"},"Remains":{"id":"Sisa","pos":"(n)"},"Built":{"id":"Dibangun","pos":"(v)"},"Century":{"id":"Abad","pos":"(n)"},"BC":{"id":"Sebelum Masehi","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2029, 18, 27, 'Para ilmuwan meneliti fosil preserved di dalam lapisan batuan sedimen.', 'Scientists study fossils preserved in sedimentary rock layers', 'Para arkeolog mempelajari artefak stored di dalam ruang penyimpanan museum.', 'Archaeologists study artifacts stored in museum storage rooms.', '{"Study":{"id":"Meneliti","pos":"(v)"},"Fossil":{"id":"Fosil","pos":"(n)"},"Preserved":{"id":"Diawetkan","pos":"(v)"},"Layer":{"id":"Lapisan","pos":"(n)"},"Sedimentary rock":{"id":"Batuan sedimen","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2030, 18, 28, 'Museum nasional menampilkan manuskrip written dalam bahasa Sanskerta.', 'The national museum displays manuscripts written in Sanskrit', 'Galeri seni memamerkan lukisan created dalam gaya Renaisans.', 'The art gallery exhibits paintings created in Renaissance style.', '{"Display":{"id":"Menampilkan","pos":"(v)"},"Manuscript":{"id":"Manuskrip","pos":"(n)"},"Written":{"id":"Ditulis","pos":"(v)"},"Sanskrit":{"id":"Sanskerta","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2031, 18, 29, 'Observatorium astronomi menggunakan teleskop designed untuk mendeteksi gelombang radio.', 'The astronomical observatory uses telescopes designed to detect radio waves', 'Laboratorium fisika mengoperasikan akselerator engineered untuk menghasilkan partikel subatomik.', 'The physics laboratory operates accelerators engineered to produce subatomic particles.', '{"Observatory":{"id":"Observatorium","pos":"(n)"},"Telescope":{"id":"Teleskop","pos":"(n)"},"Designed":{"id":"Dirancang","pos":"(v)"},"Detect":{"id":"Mendeteksi","pos":"(v)"},"Radio wave":{"id":"Gelombang radio","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2032, 18, 30, 'Universitas internasional memiliki arsip collected dari berbagai penelitian global.', 'International universities have archives collected from various global research', 'Perpustakaan digital menyimpan database compiled dari berbagai publikasi akademik.', 'Digital libraries store databases compiled from various academic publications.', '{"Archive":{"id":"Arsip","pos":"(n)"},"Collected":{"id":"Dikumpulkan","pos":"(v)"},"Various":{"id":"Berbagai","pos":"(adj)"},"Research":{"id":"Penelitian","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2033, 18, 100, 'Penelitian yang dilakukan oleh para ilmuwan menunjukkan bahwa ekosistem laut yang terancam oleh polusi plastik memerlukan tindakan segera. Spesies living di terumbu karang mengalami penurunan populasi yang signifikan. Teknologi cleaning ocean yang dikembangkan oleh perusahaan internasional mulai diimplementasikan di berbagai negara. Data collected dari satelit membantu peneliti memahami pola migrasi hewan laut. Solusi yang diusulkan oleh komunitas ilmiah mencakup pengurangan penggunaan plastik sekali pakai dan peningkatan program daur ulang.', 'Research conducted by scientists shows that marine ecosystems threatened by plastic pollution require immediate action. Species living in coral reefs experience significant population decline. Ocean cleaning technology developed by international companies is beginning to be implemented in various countries. Data collected from satellites helps researchers understand marine animal migration patterns. Solutions proposed by the scientific community include reducing single-use plastic and increasing recycling programs.', NULL, NULL, '{"Conduct":{"id":"Melakukan","pos":"(v)"},"Marine ecosystem":{"id":"Ekosistem laut","pos":"(n)"},"Threaten":{"id":"Mengancam","pos":"(v)"},"Pollution":{"id":"Polusi","pos":"(n)"},"Immediate action":{"id":"Tindakan segera","pos":"(n)"},"Coral reef":{"id":"Terumbu karang","pos":"(n)"},"Population decline":{"id":"Penurunan populasi","pos":"(n)"},"Implement":{"id":"Mengimplementasikan","pos":"(v)"},"Satellite":{"id":"Satelit","pos":"(n)"},"Migration pattern":{"id":"Pola migrasi","pos":"(n)"},"Propose":{"id":"Mengusulkan","pos":"(v)"},"Single-use plastic":{"id":"Plastik sekali pakai","pos":"(n)"},"Recycling program":{"id":"Program daur ulang","pos":"(n)"}}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'paragraph'),
(2034, 19, 1, 'Koleksi museum itu terlalu berharga untuk dipindahkan.', 'The museum collection is too valuable to be moved', 'Kopi ini terlalu panas untuk diminum.', 'This coffee is too hot to drink.', '{"Collection":{"id":"Koleksi","pos":"(n)"},"Valuable":{"id":"Berharga","pos":"(adj)"},"Move":{"id":"Dipindahkan","pos":"(v)"},"_type":"Degree Adverb","_adverb":"too"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2035, 19, 2, 'Sayangnya, banyak situs arkeologi hilang akibat pembangunan modern.', 'Unfortunately, many archaeological sites are lost due to modern development', 'Sayangnya, cuaca buruk hari ini.', 'Unfortunately, the weather is bad today.', '{"Archaeological site":{"id":"Situs arkeologi","pos":"(n)"},"Lost":{"id":"Hilang","pos":"(adj)"},"Development":{"id":"Pembangunan","pos":"(n)"},"_type":"Sentence Adverb","_adverb":"unfortunately"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2036, 19, 3, 'Para peneliti bekerja sangat hati-hati di laboratorium biologi molekuler.', 'Researchers work very carefully in the molecular biology laboratory', 'Dia membaca sangat hati-hati.', 'He reads very carefully.', '{"Researcher":{"id":"Peneliti","pos":"(n)"},"Carefully":{"id":"Hati-hati","pos":"(adv)"},"Laboratory":{"id":"Laboratorium","pos":"(n)"},"_type":"Intensifier + Manner Adverb","_adverb":"very carefully"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2037, 19, 4, 'Sungai itu tampak sangat kotor setelah banjir besar.', 'The river looks very dirty after the big flood', 'Dia sangat pintar.', 'She is very smart.', '{"River":{"id":"Sungai","pos":"(n)"},"Dirty":{"id":"Kotor","pos":"(adj)"},"Flood":{"id":"Banjir","pos":"(n)"},"_type":"Degree Adverb","_adverb":"very"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2038, 19, 5, 'Tim ekspedisi cepat menanggapi perubahan cuaca di gunung tinggi.', 'The expedition team quickly responds to weather changes in the high mountains', 'Dia berlari cepat.', 'He runs quickly.', '{"Expedition":{"id":"Ekspedisi","pos":"(n)"},"Respond":{"id":"Menanggapi","pos":"(v)"},"Weather change":{"id":"Perubahan cuaca","pos":"(n)"},"_type":"Manner Adverb","_adverb":"quickly"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2039, 19, 6, 'Gelombang radio diterima cukup jelas oleh antena komunikasi.', 'Radio waves are received quite clearly by communication antennas', 'Dia berbicara cukup jelas.', 'She speaks quite clearly.', '{"Radio wave":{"id":"Gelombang radio","pos":"(n)"},"Receive":{"id":"Diterima","pos":"(v)"},"Antenna":{"id":"Antena","pos":"(n)"},"_type":"Intensifier + Manner Adverb","_adverb":"quite clearly"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2040, 19, 7, 'Memang, urbanisasi memengaruhi struktur sosial di berbagai kota besar.', 'Indeed, urbanization affects social structures in various large cities', 'Memang, ini masalah serius.', 'Indeed, this is a serious problem.', '{"Urbanization":{"id":"Urbanisasi","pos":"(n)"},"Affect":{"id":"Memengaruhi","pos":"(v)"},"Social structure":{"id":"Struktur sosial","pos":"(n)"},"_type":"Sentence Adverb","_adverb":"indeed"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2041, 19, 8, 'Observatorium berada di lokasi sangat strategis di puncak gunung.', 'The observatory is located in a very strategic location at the mountain peak', 'Ini sangat penting.', 'This is very important.', '{"Observatory":{"id":"Observatorium","pos":"(n)"},"Strategic":{"id":"Strategis","pos":"(adj)"},"Peak":{"id":"Puncak","pos":"(n)"},"_type":"Degree Adverb","_adverb":"very"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2042, 19, 9, 'Mesin itu lambat memproses data karena keterbatasan daya.', 'The machine slowly processes data due to power limitations', 'Dia berjalan lambat.', 'He walks slowly.', '{"Machine":{"id":"Mesin","pos":"(n)"},"Process":{"id":"Memproses","pos":"(v)"},"Limitation":{"id":"Keterbatasan","pos":"(n)"},"_type":"Manner Adverb","_adverb":"slowly"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2043, 19, 10, 'Masalah sampah plastik menjadi amat serius di perkotaan modern.', 'The plastic waste problem becomes extremely serious in modern cities', 'Ini amat sulit.', 'This is extremely difficult.', '{"Plastic waste":{"id":"Sampah plastik","pos":"(n)"},"Serious":{"id":"Serius","pos":"(adj)"},"Modern city":{"id":"Perkotaan modern","pos":"(n)"},"_type":"Degree Adverb","_adverb":"extremely"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2044, 19, 11, 'Untungnya, vaksin baru berhasil menekan penyebaran penyakit.', 'Fortunately, the new vaccine successfully suppresses disease spread', 'Untungnya, dia berhasil lulus ujian.', 'Fortunately, he successfully passed the exam.', '{"Vaccine":{"id":"Vaksin","pos":"(n)"},"Suppress":{"id":"Menekan","pos":"(v)"},"Disease spread":{"id":"Penyebaran penyakit","pos":"(n)"},"_type":"Sentence Adverb + Manner Adverb","_adverb":"fortunately, successfully"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2045, 19, 12, 'Para ilmuwan teliti mengamati perilaku burung migran.', 'Scientists carefully observe migratory bird behavior', 'Dia teliti memeriksa dokumen.', 'She carefully checks the documents.', '{"Scientist":{"id":"Ilmuwan","pos":"(n)"},"Observe":{"id":"Mengamati","pos":"(v)"},"Migratory bird":{"id":"Burung migran","pos":"(n)"},"_type":"Manner Adverb","_adverb":"carefully"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2046, 19, 13, 'Perubahan suhu di gurun terasa amat tiba-tiba pada malam hari.', 'Temperature changes in the desert feel extremely sudden at night', 'Perubahan itu amat cepat.', 'The change is extremely fast.', '{"Temperature":{"id":"Suhu","pos":"(n)"},"Desert":{"id":"Gurun","pos":"(n)"},"Sudden":{"id":"Tiba-tiba","pos":"(adj)"},"_type":"Degree Adverb","_adverb":"extremely"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2047, 19, 14, 'Pusat penelitian itu rutin mengadakan konferensi internasional.', 'The research center regularly holds international conferences', 'Dia rutin berolahraga.', 'He regularly exercises.', '{"Research center":{"id":"Pusat penelitian","pos":"(n)"},"Hold":{"id":"Mengadakan","pos":"(v)"},"Conference":{"id":"Konferensi","pos":"(n)"},"_type":"Manner Adverb","_adverb":"regularly"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2048, 19, 15, 'Data genetika dianggap sangat penting untuk memahami evolusi.', 'Genetic data is considered very important for understanding evolution', 'Ini sangat berguna.', 'This is very important.', '{"Genetic data":{"id":"Data genetika","pos":"(n)"},"Consider":{"id":"Dianggap","pos":"(v)"},"Evolution":{"id":"Evolusi","pos":"(n)"},"_type":"Degree Adverb","_adverb":"very"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2049, 19, 16, 'Secara umum, teknologi digital meningkatkan efisiensi komunikasi global.', 'Generally, digital technology increases global communication efficiency', 'Secara umum, ini benar.', 'Generally, this is true.', '{"Digital technology":{"id":"Teknologi digital","pos":"(n)"},"Increase":{"id":"Meningkatkan","pos":"(v)"},"Efficiency":{"id":"Efisiensi","pos":"(n)"},"_type":"Sentence Adverb","_adverb":"generally"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2050, 19, 17, 'Para dokter cermat mendiagnosis pasien dengan metode modern.', 'Doctors carefully diagnose patients with modern methods', 'Dia cermat menganalisis data.', 'She carefully analyzes data.', '{"Doctor":{"id":"Dokter","pos":"(n)"},"Diagnose":{"id":"Mendiagnosis","pos":"(v)"},"Method":{"id":"Metode","pos":"(n)"},"_type":"Manner Adverb","_adverb":"carefully"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2051, 19, 18, 'Hujan deras menyebabkan sungai meluap sangat cepat.', 'Heavy rain causes the river to overflow very quickly', 'Dia berlari sangat cepat.', 'He runs very quickly.', '{"Heavy rain":{"id":"Hujan deras","pos":"(n)"},"Overflow":{"id":"Meluap","pos":"(v)"},"Quickly":{"id":"Cepat","pos":"(adv)"},"_type":"Intensifier + Manner Adverb","_adverb":"very quickly"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2052, 19, 19, 'Anehnya, fosil kuno ditemukan di lokasi yang jauh dari lautan.', 'Surprisingly, ancient fossils are found in locations far from the ocean', 'Anehnya, dia tidak datang.', 'Surprisingly, he did not come.', '{"Fossil":{"id":"Fosil","pos":"(n)"},"Ancient":{"id":"Kuno","pos":"(adj)"},"Ocean":{"id":"Lautan","pos":"(n)"},"_type":"Sentence Adverb","_adverb":"surprisingly"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2053, 19, 20, 'Data satelit ditransmisikan cukup cepat ke pusat kendali bumi.', 'Satellite data is transmitted quite quickly to the earth control center', 'Dia bekerja cukup cepat.', 'She works quite quickly.', '{"Satellite":{"id":"Satelit","pos":"(n)"},"Transmit":{"id":"Ditransmisikan","pos":"(v)"},"Control center":{"id":"Pusat kendali","pos":"(n)"},"_type":"Intensifier + Manner Adverb","_adverb":"quite quickly"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(2054, 19, 100, 'Memang, urbanisasi memengaruhi struktur sosial di berbagai kota besar, dan secara umum, teknologi digital meningkatkan efisiensi komunikasi global. Namun, sayangnya, banyak situs arkeologi hilang akibat pembangunan modern, meskipun beberapa koleksi museum tetap terlalu berharga untuk dipindahkan. Para ilmuwan teliti mengamati perilaku burung migran, sementara pusat penelitian rutin mengadakan konferensi internasional guna membahas isu lingkungan. Sungai besar tampak sangat kotor setelah banjir besar, dan hujan deras dapat membuat alirannya meluap sangat cepat. Anehnya, fosil kuno ditemukan di lokasi yang jauh dari lautan, sedangkan observatorium ditempatkan di lokasi sangat strategis di puncak gunung. Tim ekspedisi cepat menanggapi perubahan cuaca di dataran tinggi, dan para dokter cermat mendiagnosis pasien dengan metode modern. Data genetika dianggap sangat penting untuk memahami evolusi, dan masalah sampah plastik kini amat serius di perkotaan modern. Untungnya, vaksin baru berhasil menekan penyebaran penyakit, sementara data satelit ditransmisikan cukup cepat ke pusat kendali bumi. Gelombang radio bahkan diterima cukup jelas oleh antena komunikasi, meskipun perubahan suhu di gurun terasa amat tiba-tiba pada malam hari.', 'Indeed, urbanization affects social structures in various large cities, and generally, digital technology increases global communication efficiency. However, unfortunately, many archaeological sites are lost due to modern development, although some museum collections remain too valuable to be moved. Scientists carefully observe migratory bird behavior, while research centers regularly hold international conferences to discuss environmental issues. Large rivers look very dirty after major floods, and heavy rain can cause them to overflow very quickly. Surprisingly, ancient fossils are found in locations far from the ocean, while observatories are placed in very strategic locations at mountain peaks. Expedition teams quickly respond to weather changes in the highlands, and doctors carefully diagnose patients with modern methods. Genetic data is considered very important for understanding evolution, and the plastic waste problem is now extremely serious in modern cities. Fortunately, new vaccines successfully suppress disease spread, while satellite data is transmitted quite quickly to earth control centers. Radio waves are even received quite clearly by communication antennas, although temperature changes in the desert feel extremely sudden at night.', NULL, NULL, '{"Urbanization":"Urbanisasi","Affect":"Memengaruhi","Archaeological site":"Situs arkeologi","Valuable":"Berharga","Carefully":"Teliti\\/hati-hati","Migratory bird":"Burung migran","Regularly":"Rutin","Environmental issue":"Isu lingkungan","Overflow":"Meluap","Fossil":"Fosil","Observatory":"Observatorium","Strategic":"Strategis","Expedition":"Ekspedisi","Diagnose":"Mendiagnosis","Genetic data":"Data genetika","Evolution":"Evolusi","Plastic waste":"Sampah plastik","Suppress":"Menekan","Transmit":"Mentransmisikan"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'paragraph'),
(2055, 20, 100, 'Perubahan lingkungan kini menjadi isu global yang semakin mendesak dan tidak dapat diabaikan. Banyak komunitas ilmiah di seluruh dunia sedang meneliti dampak pemanasan global terhadap keanekaragaman hayati di kawasan pesisir, hutan hujan tropis, dan wilayah kutub yang sensitif. Saya sendiri telah melihat bagaimana kualitas air menurun secara drastis selama satu dekade terakhir, terutama di daerah pesisir tempat saya melakukan penelitian kecil bersama kelompok konservasi lokal. Pada masa lalu, pemerintah membangun banyak program konservasi, tetapi sebagian besar tidak dijalankan secara efektif sehingga manfaatnya tidak dapat dirasakan secara nyata oleh masyarakat. Saat ini, prioritas utama adalah melindungi ekosistem laut, yang merupakan sumber kehidupan bagi jutaan orang dan menopang perekonomian daerah pesisir. Para ilmuwan yang saya temui menjelaskan bahwa perubahan iklim tidak hanya mempengaruhi spesies langka, tetapi juga ekonomi nelayan lokal yang semakin rentan terhadap badai dan ketidakpastian cuaca. Mereka menggunakan pengumpulan data secara sistematis untuk meningkatkan akurasi penelitian dan memperkirakan tren lingkungan jangka panjang. Untuk memahami penyebab utama kerusakan lingkungan, banyak peneliti melakukan analisis mendalam dengan metode yang lebih efisien melalui kolaborasi antaruniversitas dan lembaga internasional. Ekosistem terumbu karang adalah salah satu ekosistem paling rentan di dunia, karena lokasi di mana intensitas polusi sangat tinggi dan suhu permukaan laut terus meningkat. Komunitas nelayan, yang wilayahnya terancam naiknya permukaan laut akibat mencairnya es di kutub, terus berjuang mempertahankan mata pencaharian mereka meskipun bantuan pemerintah sering terlambat dan tidak mencukupi. Beberapa kelompok masyarakat mengembangkan strategi konservasi berbasis budaya lokal dengan harapan dapat meningkatkan kesadaran publik melalui pendidikan lingkungan dan pelatihan pengelolaan laut berkelanjutan.', 'Environmental change is now an increasingly urgent global issue that cannot be ignored. Many scientific communities around the world are researching the impact of global warming on biodiversity in coastal areas, tropical rainforests, and sensitive polar regions. I myself have seen how water quality has declined drastically over the last decade, especially in coastal areas where I conduct small research with local conservation groups. In the past, the government built many conservation programs, but most were not implemented effectively so that the benefits could not be felt tangibly by the community. Currently, the main priority is protecting marine ecosystems, which are a source of life for millions of people and support the economy of coastal areas. The scientists I met explained that climate change not only affects rare species, but also the economy of local fishermen who are increasingly vulnerable to storms and weather uncertainty. They use systematic data collection to improve research accuracy and predict long-term environmental trends. To understand the main causes of environmental damage, many researchers conduct in-depth analysis with more efficient methods through collaboration between universities and international institutions. Coral reef ecosystems are one of the most vulnerable ecosystems in the world, due to locations where pollution intensity is very high and sea surface temperatures continue to rise. Fishing communities, whose territories are threatened by rising sea levels due to melting polar ice, continue to struggle to maintain their livelihoods even though government assistance is often late and insufficient. Some community groups develop conservation strategies based on local culture with the hope of increasing public awareness through environmental education and sustainable marine management training.', NULL, NULL, '{"Environmental change":"Perubahan lingkungan","Urgent":"Mendesak","Global issue":"Isu global","Ignored":"Diabaikan","Scientific community":"Komunitas ilmiah","Research":"Meneliti","Impact":"Dampak","Global warming":"Pemanasan global","Biodiversity":"Keanekaragaman hayati","Coastal area":"Kawasan pesisir","Tropical rainforest":"Hutan hujan tropis","Polar region":"Wilayah kutub","Sensitive":"Sensitif","Water quality":"Kualitas air","Decline":"Menurun","Drastically":"Secara drastis","Decade":"Dekade","Conservation group":"Kelompok konservasi","Conservation program":"Program konservasi","Implemented":"Dijalankan","Effectively":"Secara efektif","Benefits":"Manfaat","Tangibly":"Secara nyata","Priority":"Prioritas","Marine ecosystem":"Ekosistem laut","Source of life":"Sumber kehidupan","Support":"Menopang","Economy":"Perekonomian","Climate change":"Perubahan iklim","Rare species":"Spesies langka","Fisherman":"Nelayan","Vulnerable":"Rentan","Storm":"Badai","Uncertainty":"Ketidakpastian","Systematic":"Sistematis","Accuracy":"Akurasi","Predict":"Memperkirakan","Trend":"Tren","Long-term":"Jangka panjang","Damage":"Kerusakan","Analysis":"Analisis","In-depth":"Mendalam","Efficient":"Efisien","Collaboration":"Kolaborasi","Coral reef":"Terumbu karang","Intensity":"Intensitas","Pollution":"Polusi","Surface":"Permukaan","Threatened":"Terancam","Melting":"Mencairnya","Struggle":"Berjuang","Livelihood":"Mata pencaharian","Assistance":"Bantuan","Insufficient":"Tidak mencukupi","Awareness":"Kesadaran","Sustainable":"Berkelanjutan"}', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', '2026-03-16 03:04:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'paragraph');
